<title>USA: Runnemede BOE, N.J. won by PNC Capital.</title>
<headline>Runnemede BOE, N.J. won by PNC Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>PNC Capital said it won $2.95 million of Runnemede, Board of Education, N.J., school bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.1542 percent.</p>
</text>
